Start
 ^       -----------        -------                      ----------- ----------- -> Routes

Routes
 ^  \S \S\S -> Continue.Record
 ^  ${Protocol} ${Type} ${Prefix}\s+via ${Gateway}\s+${Distance}/${Metric}\s+${LastChange}
 ^\s+via ${Gateway}
"""

